            </div>
            <div class="step-node">
              <div class="step-circle"><i class="fa-solid fa-plane-departure"></i></div>
              <div>
                <span class="step-time-label">Day 9–15</span>
                <h4 class="step-title">Visa Handover & Fly</h4>
                <p class="step-desc">Candidate verifies visa on official portal, completes direct embassy processing, and boards flight.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

